<body>
    <h1>Meeting Minutes of 2026/05/18 - Plan Sharing</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"789429891717">Hi all,</p>
<p local-id=3D"1dcc288a1883">Thank you all for attending this meeting. Belo=
w are the meeting minutes and future work arrangements.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9ec1375f817d"><strong>Quick Recap</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"36215538c3c5">This meeting is the second meeting of the =E6=
=B1=87=E4=B8=B0=E7=A7=91=E6=8A=80=E8=8F=81=E8=8B=B1=E8=AE=AD=E7=BB=83=E8=90=
=A5 =E2=80=93 AI=E6=99=BA=E8=83=BD=E9=97=AE=E7=AD=94=E5=8A=A9=E6=89=8B. Thi=
s meeting was an architecture sharing session for the team=E2=80=99s AI ass=
istant system development, mainly discussing the system design plans propos=
ed by each member. Team members presented different system architecture sch=
emes, including components such as the user layer, security layer, core age=
nt layer and data persistence layer, and put forward their suggestions and =
opinions on the system. Everyone shared their respective design ideas. In t=
he next step, the team needs to improve the details of each module and conf=
irm a unified plan.</p>
<p local-id=3D"c624113b91d6"><strong>Plan Sharing</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"e8917f154dc8">
<li local-id=3D"9458c77b6fa3">
<p local-id=3D"7a18012ce64d">=E7=A9=86=E5=85=89=E8=BF=9C=EF=BC=9AShared the=
 design ideas of Agent system, including memory retrieval system, multi-age=
nt communication mechanism and other technologies.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eddf3ec6f910">
<p local-id=3D"cdc4f2ba2b35">=E7=8E=8B=E9=80=B8=E6=9B=A6=EF=BC=9AShared the=
 overall system architecture, including user layer, gateway and security la=
yer, core agent layer, data persistence storage layer and infrastructure la=
yer. The architecture is clear and can be taken as the foundation. Priority=
 needs to be sorted out and work promoted by functional points in the follo=
w-up.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ae277edf6c30">
<p local-id=3D"0105b243b65c">=E9=92=9F=E5=AE=B6=E8=BF=9B=EF=BC=9AMade discu=
ssions based on user layer and data layer. In user layer, he considered que=
stion interface, multi-person dialogue and exception handling; in data laye=
r, he focused on chunking, database construction and retrieval.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"741d3fd76668">
<p local-id=3D"0439ec876c88">=E8=B0=A2=E5=B2=B1=E6=B1=9F=E5=92=8C=E6=88=B4=
=E5=98=89=E5=85=B4=EF=BC=9ADesigned Confluence knowledge base to achieve co=
ntent structuring, answer generation and citation, and set up evaluation an=
d testing criteria. It also covers modules such as data access, data cleani=
ng, chunking, metadata indexing and permission filtering.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"35103ea1bd68">
<p local-id=3D"e9a5cd4cc22c">=E5=88=98=E6=85=A7=E8=8A=B3=EF=BC=9AProposed t=
o build a user feedback collection system, and optimize model retrieval str=
ategies and prompt templates.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c2566d3ec315">
<p local-id=3D"92de004c6132">=E5=AE=8B=E7=A9=97=E6=9D=B0=EF=BC=9ASuggested =
realizing the complete RAG closed loop first. Adopt Apache Tika technology =
for document warehousing links, and keep user question-and-answer links con=
sistent with existing designs.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"64e7d244f741">
<p local-id=3D"9be033870fef">=E6=88=90=E6=BE=8D=EF=BC=9APut forward adding =
audit logs, IP whitelist and role management functions. Apply the shortest =
job first strategy to multi-agent collaboration, and add dialogue export fu=
nction.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"dcd97d77fe7a"><strong>Discussion Summary</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"3ec4cdc6c2f3">
<li local-id=3D"aad64bc439ea">
<p local-id=3D"f6e505881753">Agreed to hold regular meetings weekly at the =
start of the project, with a move to a bi-weekly cadence later. Each meetin=
g will follow a three-part agenda: AI knowledge sharing, project progress u=
pdates, and issue discussion.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"9463a1178a3d">Action Items:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"9d794bb57201">
<li local-id=3D"cf752722d771">
<p local-id=3D"5b2339577db7"><strong>All team members</strong>: Before the =
next meeting, refine the functions of the original architecture solutions, =
confirm the specific function list to be delivered for the July demo, and w=
ork out relevant implementation plans.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"07014e99fec3">
<p local-id=3D"9c7a098fc4d4"><strong>All team members:</strong> Upload the =
discussed solutions and meeting minutes to the Confluence platform.</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"5feeacba8c3c">
<p local-id=3D"f745dc4487a3"><strong>All team members:</strong> Compile a C=
onfluence usage guide to standardize document uploading for other teams in =
follow-up work.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2802d2a0ac8f">
<p local-id=3D"8493338dd730"><strong>All team members:</strong> Independent=
ly explore AI coding and prepare the sharing.</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"fece3ec3e05a">Kind regards,</p>
<p local-id=3D"22e09ef3ea15"><strong>Yixi Wang</strong></p>
    </div>
</body>
